{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","data":{"body":"Open after this session. RuntimeCaps.max_tool_calls at 60 truncates implementations and is the prerequisite for retrying 53ed. ADEVX-131 remains open with its extra-tests patch still to re-apply and its stale contention theory still to correct. The rebar plan-review P9 file-impact-coverage gate passed 53ed while its change invalidated two undeclared snapshots, and no ticket covers that. Nothing in the agentic-development-platform stack has merged, PRs 12 through 23 are all open and stacked."},"env_id":"8c3ef925-fbdc-4d88-8d59-f391cf59568c","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1789933879325929001,"uuid":"8fbf982f-e103-480d-b46d-1721ea26f6c4"}